@startuml
title LSW 组件调用关系
actor User
component "lsw CLI" as CLI
component "lsw_core" as Core
component "lswd" as Daemon
component "QEMU/KVM" as QEMU
component "QMP Client" as QMP
component "Windows OpenSSH" as WinSSH
component "PowerShell" as PS
component "SMB/CIFS" as SMB
component "Linux $HOME" as Home

User --> CLI
CLI --> Core
CLI --> Daemon : Unix Socket JSON\n$RUNTIME/lsw/lswd.sock
Daemon --> Core
Daemon --> QEMU : spawn
Daemon --> QMP : control\n$RUNTIME/lsw/qmp.sock
QMP --> QEMU
Daemon --> WinSSH : ssh -t / exec\n$WINDOWS_USER@127.0.0.1:2222
WinSSH --> PS
Daemon --> SMB : mount.cifs
SMB --> Home : Z: 映射
@enduml
